{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55143","headline":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 三十三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占六壬第二十八（京本列第十七○四十五首） 三十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勾陈将，玄武共相亲。\n带煞并加爲恶煞，若逢相克不宜军（京本作「君」），有煞便相侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}